L32_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_INTERLUDE1"
L33_1 = [[
The black flames that engulf the world sometimes even burn predetermined fates.
The inevitable, disguised as coincidence, emerges from the ashes.]]
L31_1[1] = L32_1
L31_1[2] = L33_1
L32_1 = {}
L33_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_INTERLUDE3"
L34_1 = [[
The establishment of Prydwen Institution dates back to the era of the British Empire.
The empire on which the sun never sets absorbed massive resources and culture through its colonies around the world.
Of course, some of them included relics of Counterside.]]
L32_1[1] = L33_1
L32_1[2] = L34_1
L33_1 = {}
L34_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_1_1"
L35_1 = [[
There was a girl.
She was usually cowardly, but she was courageous that day.
She woke up with a sword in her arms.
She named that sword Toto.]]
L33_1[1] = L34_1
L33_1[2] = L35_1
L34_1 = {}
L35_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_INTERLUDE2"
L36_1 = [[
Prepare the feast. A new dawn is coming.
The feast will complete the imperfect knowledge and perfect the imperfect beings.]]
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
L35_1 = {}
L36_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_1_2"
L37_1 = [[
He was a shadow of the Institution and always took care of the dirty work.
He never hesitated to get his hands bloodied.
He was never afraid to be lonely.
At some point, people started calling him "a man who stood on the verge of greatness."]]
L35_1[1] = L36_1
L35_1[2] = L37_1
L36_1 = {}
L37_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_INTERLUDE4"
L38_1 = [[
As Counterside was discovered, information on the relic started to overflow.
However, most of the rumors were a cover-up by the Institution, containing a mix of truth and lies.]]
L36_1[1] = L37_1
L36_1[2] = L38_1
L37_1 = {}
L38_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_INTERLUDE5"
L39_1 = [[
Prepare the feast of knowledge.
Start the banquet.]]
L37_1[1] = L38_1
L37_1[2] = L39_1
L38_1 = {}
L39_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_1_3"
L40_1 = "The Lake of Knowledge must become one."
L38_1[1] = L39_1
L38_1[2] = L40_1
