L22_1 = "A kiss from me will bless you with the grace of angels. If you feel like you're having a bad day, just come up to me and show me your forehead! Oh, right. But tell me in advance if you have a cold, okay? I-it's a little embarrassing, but I don't have an immune system for diseases in the human world yet. Hehe..."
