L27_1 = "SI_EPISODE_DESC_1_SS_MOONLIGHT"
L28_1 = [[
An exorcist nun who makes a living solving hauntings.
One day, she's invited to a mansion by a wealthy client. But as always, making money is never easy.]]
L26_1[1] = L27_1
L26_1[2] = L28_1
L27_1 = {}
L28_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_PROLOGUE"
L29_1 = [[
Experiencing strange phenomena? Objects moving on their own? Hearing eerie noises?
For those sleepless nights, we've prepared a special exorcism package!
For more inquiries, contact us at the number below.]]
L27_1[1] = L28_1
L27_1[2] = L29_1
L28_1 = {}
L29_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE1"
L30_1 = "It was too much to turn down."
L28_1[1] = L29_1
L28_1[2] = L30_1
L29_1 = {}
L30_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE2"
L31_1 = [[
Following the recent wave of Corruption disasters, the price of Eternium surged.
Investors moved quickly, but as always, not everyone kept up.]]
L29_1[1] = L30_1
L29_1[2] = L31_1
L30_1 = {}
L31_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE3"
L32_1 = [[
People fear the unseen, the unknown.
The Valentinus Monastery took advantage of that.
They profited by disguising undiscovered Counterside Effects as hauntings.
That's what they call an exorcism.]]
L30_1[1] = L31_1
L30_1[2] = L32_1
L31_1 = {}
L32_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE4"
L33_1 = [[
Hiding a child wasn't that difficult.
No one ever visited the monastery, and intruders were easy to deal with.
But when the child grew up and said she wanted to leave,
I felt a strange sense of loss.]]
L31_1[1] = L32_1
L31_1[2] = L33_1
L32_1 = {}
L33_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE5"
L34_1 = "Everyone has a plan."
L32_1[1] = L33_1
L32_1[2] = L34_1
L33_1 = {}
L34_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE6"
L35_1 = [[
A heightened sense of smell sometimes picks up scents that others can't detect.
Asphalt, blood, Corruption rays... even the lingering scent of the past.]]
L33_1[1] = L34_1
L33_1[2] = L35_1
L34_1 = {}
L35_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE7"
L36_1 = [[
A searing pain, like my blood was boiling. Rage. The instinct to destroy everything awakened.
I laughed through my tears.
The freedom was exhilarating.
But also terrifying.]]
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
L35_1 = {}
L36_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE8"
L37_1 = [[
Rabies infects all mammals, including humans.
It causes aggression, an intense fear of water, and an aversion to light.
In the past, people believed those infected were cursed and turned into monsters.]]
L35_1[1] = L36_1
L35_1[2] = L37_1
L36_1 = {}
L37_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE9"
L38_1 = "As you live, you realize that some things matter more than money."
L36_1[1] = L37_1
L36_1[2] = L38_1
L37_1 = {}
L38_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE10"
L39_1 = "It's so good, I can't even think of grape juice."
L37_1[1] = L38_1
L37_1[2] = L39_1
L38_1 = {}
L39_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE11"
L40_1 = [[
I thought I was used to the smell of blood.
But when the girl before me collapsed, bleeding out,
I realized I wasn't.]]
L38_1[1] = L39_1
L38_1[2] = L40_1
L39_1 = {}
L40_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE12"
L41_1 = [[
My colleagues and I studied Corruption, convinced humanity would one day conquer it.
But after ten, twenty years, all I had left was a failing body and research that led nowhere.
That's when I made a deal with the devil.]]
L39_1[1] = L40_1
L39_1[2] = L41_1
L40_1 = {}
L41_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE13"
L42_1 = [[
When the last failure begged for mercy, fury overtook me.
I threw him into the chamber where the other families awaited.
They, now C.O.s, reached out to the trembling failure, drawn to his possibilities that they lacked.]]
L40_1[1] = L41_1
L40_1[2] = L42_1
L41_1 = {}
L42_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE14"
L43_1 = [[
Observation Record:
Initial symptoms include a heightened sense of smell, detecting odors undetectable to ordinary humans.
Then comes pain, like boiling blood.
Hair and nails grow rapidly, and most subjects become violently aggressive.]]
L41_1[1] = L42_1
L41_1[2] = L43_1
L42_1 = {}
L43_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE15"
L44_1 = [[
I once drank grape juice, pretending it was holy blood, whenever my thirst became unbearable.
To crave another's blood felt like the greatest sin.
But deep down, I knew.
One day, grape juice wouldn't be enough.]]
L42_1[1] = L43_1
L42_1[2] = L44_1
L43_1 = {}
L44_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE16"
L45_1 = "When the serpent of Eden tempted Eve with the forbidden fruit, I imagine this was the scent in the air."
L43_1[1] = L44_1
L43_1[2] = L45_1
L44_1 = {}
L45_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE17"
L46_1 = [[
Confession services are available only to donors.
Additional charges apply after the allocated time.]]
L44_1[1] = L45_1
L44_1[2] = L46_1
L45_1 = {}
L46_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_MOONLIGHT_INTERLUDE18"
L47_1 = [[
I left my hometown to break the curse.
It was a place so warm and cozy, so the fear of growing complacent in my current situation started to overwhelm me.]]
L45_1[1] = L46_1
