L51_1 = "Iced... Americano? O-of course I drink it. It's, like, the total city girl aesthetic, y'know. Ugh, it's so bitter...! I mean, I've just been cravin' a sugar rush lately. You didn't happen to bring sugar or creamer, did you?"
